        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: KILROY International A/S\n- People: James J. Kilroy\n- Places: Denmark, Scandinavia, Fore River Shipyard\n- Concepts: \"Kilroy was here\" expression\n\nFacts:\n- James J. Kilroy was born on September 26, 1902.\n- KILROY International A/S is a Danish company.\n- James J. Kilroy worked at the Fore River Shipyard.\n- In 1991, KILROY International A/S was founded after the merger of a number of Scandinavian travel agents.\n- James J. Kilroy died on November 24, 1962.\n- James J. Kilroy is believed to have originated the expression \"Kilroy was here.\"",
